	linkml:description "The predicate that records one step of an in-toto layout: the command it ran and the materials it read, for a supply chain that migrates from in-toto 0.9 links." ;
	linkml:is_a <https://w3id.org/lmodel/in-toto/InTotoPredicate> ;
	linkml:slot_usage _:c14n47 ;
	linkml:slots <https://w3id.org/lmodel/in-toto/inTotoLink__materials> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/in-toto/inTotoLink__step_byproducts> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/in-toto/inTotoLink__step_command> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/in-toto/inTotoLink__step_environment> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/in-toto/inTotoLink__step_name> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/in-toto/inTotoPredicate__predicate_kind> .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/in-toto/InTotoLinkMaterial> a linkml:ClassDefinition ;
