	linkml:description "A LinkML model of the in-toto Attestation Framework: the statement that binds an attestation to its subjects, the resource descriptor and digest set that identify an artifact, the predicate types the in-toto project has vetted, and the vetted predicates that no other lmodel schema models." ;
